      {
       "_key": "000000000002",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Embark on an enchanting journey to the lesser-trodden paths of Egypt with these meticulously curated tours, each offering a unique blend of history, culture, and breathtaking landscapes."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
