      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Fayoum Oasis, Hawara & Meidum Excursion"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000010",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000006",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Escape the beaten path and delve into the heart of Egypt’s rich history with a day trip to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000008",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000007"
       ],
       "text": "the Fayoum Oasis"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000009",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". This hidden gem, often overlooked by mainstream tourism, is a portal to the past, dating back to the Middle Kingdom. Here, you’ll discover the architectural marvels of the "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000000a"
       ],
       "text": "Hawara"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " and Meidum Pyramids, each with a fascinating tale etched into their ancient stones. Immerse yourself in the allure of the Egyptian countryside, "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000000d"
       ],
       "text": "exploring these monumental"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " testaments to a civilization that has captivated the world for millennia. This tour promises not just a journey through Egypt’s history, but an intimate encounter with its timeless spirit."
      }
     ],
