       "_key": "000000000015",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Set sail on a luxurious voyage along the lifeblood of "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000017",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000016"
       ],
       "text": "Egypt"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000018",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " – the majestic Nile River. Aboard a handpicked cruise renowned for its exquisite service and international culinary offerings, you’ll journey through "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000019"
       ],
       "text": "Egypt’s"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " heartland. Witness the intricate artistry of ancient burial sites carved into rock faces, explore enigmatic pyramids with their hidden chambers, and "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001c"
       ],
       "text": "wander"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " through sprawling temple complexes. In towns like "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000020",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001f"
       ],
       "text": "Beni Suef"
      },
      {
       "_key": "tb4d1urj1euq",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", a hub for cotton-spinning and carpet-weaving, you’ll connect with the essence of local life. "
      },
      {
       "_key": "2q8c00eyeize",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "wq9e4ktpikbp"
       ],
       "text": "Luxor"
      },
      {
       "_key": "lzmp8ntpwh6a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " awaits with its iconic "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000023",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000022"
       ],
       "text": "Karnak and Luxor temples"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000024",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", immersing you in a realm of ancient grandeur. Conclude your remarkable journey in Aswan, a sun-drenched city that harmonizes "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000026",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000025"
       ],
       "text": "Nubian culture"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000027",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " with modern vibrancy. This 14-day cruise isn’t just a tour; it’s a journey through the very soul of "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000029",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000028"
       ],
